        { icon: "📖", title: "RC Precision Over Speed", desc: "Reading Comprehension carries roughly half the section. Accuracy here, not speed, is what separates top scorers. Practice active reading — map the author's tone and structure before you look at options." },
        { icon: "🧠", title: "Master the CR Question Types", desc: "Critical Reasoning rewards pattern recognition — assumption, strengthen/weaken, and inference questions each need a distinct approach. A disciplined method across these can move you several scaled points." },
